# (CR 603.12). Bot2 has two Rooms, Roaring Furnace and Unholy Annex, and other permanents: Ornithopter and Mox Jet are
# not Rooms and are refused. Bot1 destroys Unholy Annex: only that Room goes to Bot2's graveyard, the other stays, and
